      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-21T17:30:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I play Sentinels of the Multiverse at my lunch hour. I also play it&nbsp;sometimes by myself. Outside that my regular gaming group doesn't like it.</p><p>So, if Sentinels Tactics doesn't fit in an hour and I can't play it myself then I don't think I'll be able to back Tactics.</p><p>I usually do play with new players at lunch. SotM with new players is still under an hour for half the villains. (We've actually decided who is a \"lunch\" villain).</p>",
