      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-21T17:45:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It also depends on the type of game you're playing. I think the scenarios (or at least an individual \"chapter\" for a multi-chapter scenario) are going to be quicker, and I think they will run an hour or so. I base that mostly on what I've been told by others (including the &gt;G folks), as I've honestly only seen one: the Baron Blade scenario included on the Kickstarter video, and I believe 2 of the players hadn't played before and one of the others had only played a couple times.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
