      "raw": "<p>It also depends on the type of game you&#39;re playing. I think the scenarios (or at least an individual &quot;chapter&quot; for a multi-chapter scenario) are going to be quicker, and I think they will run an hour or so. I base that mostly on what I&#39;ve been told by others (including the &gt;G folks), as I&#39;ve honestly only seen one: the Baron Blade scenario included on the Kickstarter video, and I believe 2 of the players hadn&#39;t played before and one of the others had only played a couple times.</p>",
