    {
      "id": 99768,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-04-21T20:48:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Your first games will take longer naturally.</p><p>Normally it takes about 1 minute a turn for my group. &nbsp;Others seem to have much slower gameplay.</p><p>I'd say it depends on your group and how long they take to make decisions about what to do on their turns.</p><p>My Sister, B-i-L and I have run the Baron Blade and Omnitron starting scenarios in ~20 minutes. &nbsp;The second ones take a bit longer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Once your players are used to the game I think you could do it. &nbsp;At first I'd run some skirmishes just to get the rules down and the turn time reduced.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:27:50.968Z",
